ON THE WEIGHTS
--------------
The checkpoints mozo publishes for this package are LLMDet's, from the authors'
own Hugging Face organisation:

  - https://huggingface.co/iSEE-Laboratory/llmdet_tiny
  - https://huggingface.co/iSEE-Laboratory/llmdet_base
  - https://huggingface.co/iSEE-Laboratory/llmdet_large

Each model card states `license: apache-2.0`, and the repositories are ungated.
The LLMDet code repository is Apache-2.0 as well. The NOTICE placed beside each
checkpoint names the exact file, commit and sha256 it was repacked from.

The weights were trained on datasets that carry their own terms -- Objects365,
GoldG (Flickr30k Entities, GQA), V3Det, GRIT, OpenImages and the authors'
GroundingCap-1M, built partly on COCO. Those terms are the datasets', not
restated here.

THE TEXT VOCABULARY AND CHARACTER TABLE
---------------------------------------
  - BERT
    Copyright 2018 The Google AI Language Team Authors
    https://huggingface.co/bert-base-uncased
    Apache License, Version 2.0

  assets/vocab.txt.gz is Google's bert-base-uncased vocab.txt, 30,522 entries,
  compressed and otherwise unmodified; it is byte-identical to the vocab.txt in
  each LLMDet repository. The *weights* of the BERT tower are not Google's --
  they are the fine-tuned copy carried inside each checkpoint.

  assets/bert_chars.json.gz records, for every Unicode codepoint, what the
  Hugging Face `tokenizers` library (Apache-2.0) does to it when it runs this
  vocabulary's normaliser and pre-tokenizer. It is derived by probing that
  library and contains no code from it.

